[Item renames]
description=Renames Corundum materials and equipment using Sapphire and Ruby. Rename Steel 2 and Mullock 2 materials and their equipment as Wootz and Flux. Renames Bilqs equipment as Bilqis and the Lightning damage category as Electric.
