[Status Menu - Static Baseline Preview]
description=Live monster rank, treasure and battle contributions, with the projected Baseline.
author=im_biggy
// SLUS-20678 / 82BD9123. Uses the existing patch toggle.
// Version 2. Use a pre-menu save state after updating from version 1.
// Refresh by opening the adventure party menu or moving its cursor after loading a save state.
// M uses floor(min(M,99)/2). X and Y use floor(min(X or Y,99)/4).
// Projected Baseline includes the verified adventure module Z and caps at 99.
// Reload a clean save state or restart after disabling to clear the modified script in RAM.
